  "definition": "Renewable Energy",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-01-08",
  "historyNote": "#10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.14) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.17); ss by #13080, eff 9-14 20 (formerly Puc 902.18)",
