  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.25 Renewable Energy",
  "priorExpiration": "2014-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.25 “Renewable Energy” means electricity produced by renewable resources including geothermal, tidal or wave, wind, solar, landfill gas, hydro, biomass, bio-oil, bio-synthetic gas, and biodiesel resources.\n\nSource. #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.14)\n\nNew. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.17); ss by #13080, eff 9-14 20 (formerly Puc 902.18)",
